    "chunk_text": "Se ealdor hit beginne, & \u00fea o\u00f0re andswarion, Domine ad adiuuandum me festina; & \u00feonne Gloria Eft si\u00f0\u00f0An \u00fe\u00e6t fers, Respice in seruos tuos, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s sealmes ende, & \u00feonne Gloria. & sy\u00f0\u00f0an cwe\u00f0e se ealdor, Oremus. Dirigere et sanctificare et custodire digneris, Domine Ihesu Christe, Fili dei uiui, hodie corda et Amen. \u00deonne, Adiutorium nostrum, In nomine Domini, qui fecit celum et terram. \u00c6fter \u00fean se \u00f0e gilti beo, bidde him forgifnysse, & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s gyltes m\u00e6\u00f0e sy him demed. & \u00feam \u00fee forgifnysse bidde, swa he eadmodra beo, & his gyltes ge\u00feafera, swa micle mildelicor & Hit is neod \u00fe\u00e6t ealle ure gimeleasta, \u00fe\u00e6t is ge\u00feohta & spr\u00e6ce & weorca, on \u00feis anwearda life \u00feurh Be heora handa weorce d\u00e6ghwamlice. \u00d0onne preostas fram capitule arison, gangon, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6tg\u00e6dere o\u00f0\u00f0e onsundrum, to \u00feam worce \u00fee him & \u00feonne hi heora worc beginnon, \u00feonne cwe\u00f0an hi Benedictus es Domine Deus, qui adiuuasti me et Misereatur nostri omnipotens Deus, amen. & \u00feonne hi ne \u00feurfon gem\u00e6ne worc weorcean, wirce \u00e6lc sum \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee his agen neod sy, & Be \u00ferym tidum \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges. Vnderntide & midd\u00e6gtide & nontide se witiga Danihel & \u00fea \u00fery haligan cnihtas mid heora halsingum Swylce fram \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges upspringe to halsungtiman \u00fereo tida syn for\u00f0 a\u00f0enede, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6re hal",
